msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/serving-architecture.md:117
msgid "当单机吞吐不够时，将推理拆到独立 Worker"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/serving-architecture.md:118
msgid "当单个 Worker 不够时，横向增加 Worker 数量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/serving-architecture.md:120
msgid "不要一开始就搭建完整的分布式系统——你很可能不需要它。过早分布式只会增加运维负担，不会提升任何实际体验。"
msgstr ""

